in region is obstructed, resulting in neurological deficits.", "keyTakeaways": ["Timely recognition and management of ischemic stroke can significantly improve patient outcomes."], "blueprintTopic": "stroke-management", "blueprintSystem": "behavioral-nervous", "generationMeta": {"rationaleModel": "gpt-4o-mini", "rationaleEnrichedAt": "2026-07-22T15:45:22.735Z", "rationaleQualityScore": 100}}$o1449$::text,
